+# git-stat
+
+Advanced git repository statistics — contributors, activity heatmap, hourly/weekday patterns, and file type analysis.
+
+## Features
+
+- Top contributors with commit counts and line changes
+- Activity heatmap (calendar-style, last N days)
+- Commits by hour of day
+- Commits by day of week (weekends highlighted)
+- File type statistics (by extension)
+- JSON output for dashboards and scripting
+- Works on any git repository
+
+## Installation
+
+```bash
+pip install git+https://github.com/TataneSan/git-stat.git
+
+# Or from source
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/git-stat.git
+cd git-stat
+pip install -e .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+# Stats for current repo
+git-stat
+
+# Stats for specific repo
+git-stat /path/to/repo
+
+# Show top 20 contributors
+git-stat --top 20
+
+# 6-month activity heatmap
+git-stat --heatmap 180
+
+# JSON output
+git-stat --json
+
+# Only show contributors
+git-stat --section contributors
+
+# Only show heatmap
+git-stat --section heatmap
+```
+
+## Output Sections
+
+### Repository Overview
+```
+  Total commits: 1,234
+  Active days:   156
+  Insertions:    +45,678
+  Deletions:     -12,345
+```
+
+### Top Contributors
+```
+  Alice            ██████████████████████████  523 commits  +12345 -3456
+  Bob              ████████████████            312 commits  +8901  -2345
+  Charlie          ███████                     156 commits  +4567  -1234
+```
+
+### Activity Heatmap
+```
+       Mon Tue Wed Thu Fri Sat Sun
+  Jan  ·   ░   ▒   ▓   █   ·   ·
+  Feb  ░   ▒   ▓   █   █   ░   ·
+  ...
+```
+
+### File Type Statistics
+```
+  .py            ██████████████████    45 files  +3456 -789
