+# base64-cli
+
+> Encode/decode base64, base32, hex with auto-detection.
+
+A Python CLI for encoding and decoding data in multiple formats. Features automatic encoding detection so you can just paste and decode.
+
+## Features
+
+- 🔤 **5 encodings** — base64, base64url, base32, hex, URL-encoding
+- 🔍 **Auto-detect** — paste any encoded string and it figures out the format
+- 📁 **File support** — encode/decode files directly
+- 📥 **Stdin support** — pipe data from other commands
+- 📐 **Line wrapping** — wrap base64 output at N characters
+- 🔄 **Roundtrip safe** — encode → decode → identical data
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+# From source
+pip install .
+
+# Or just run directly
+python base64_cli/main.py
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+base64-cli <command> [input] [options]
+```
+
+Short alias: `b64`
+
+## Commands
+
+### `encode` (alias: `enc`, `e`)
+
+```bash
+base64-cli encode "Hello, World!"
+# SGVsbG8sIFdvcmxkIQ==
+
+base64-cli encode -t hex "Hello"
+# 48656c6c6f
+
+base64-cli encode -t base32 "Hello"
+# JBSWY3DP
+
+base64-cli encode -t url "Hello World"
+# Hello%20World
+
+base64-cli encode -t base64url "path/to/something"
+# cGF0aC90by9zb21ldGhpbmc=
+```
+
+### `decode` (alias: `dec`, `d`)
+
+```bash
+# Auto-detect encoding
+base64-cli decode "SGVsbG8sIFdvcmxkIQ=="
+# Hello, World!
+
+# Specify encoding
+base64-cli decode -t hex "48656c6c6f"
+# Hello
+
+# Decode file
+base64-cli decode -f encoded.txt
+```
+
+### `detect`
+
+```bash
+base64-cli detect "SGVsbG8="
+# base64
+
+base64-cli detect "48656c6c6f"
+# hex
+
