+# markdown-api
+
+> REST API to convert Markdown to HTML and PDF.
+
+A self-hosted API that converts Markdown text into styled HTML pages, PDF documents, or raw HTML fragments. Supports GitHub Flavored Markdown, HTML sanitization, and custom CSS injection.
+
+## Features
+
+- 📄 **HTML output** — full styled HTML page with clean typography
+- 📑 **PDF generation** — A4 PDF documents with custom margins
+- 🔧 **Raw HTML** — HTML fragment for embedding
+- 🐙 **GFM support** — tables, task lists, strikethrough, autolinks
+- 🛡️ **HTML sanitization** — XSS-safe output via DOMPurify
+- 🎨 **Custom CSS** — inject your own styles
+- 📝 **Flexible input** — raw markdown body or JSON payload
+- 🛡️ **Secure** — rate limiting, CORS, Helmet headers
+- 🐳 **Docker ready** — included Dockerfile
+
+## Quick Start
+
+```bash
+# Install
+npm install
+
+# Start server (default port 3001)
+npm start
+```
+
+## Docker
+
+```bash
+docker build -t markdown-api .
+docker run -p 3001:3001 markdown-api
+```
+
+## API Endpoints
+
+### `POST /api/html`
+
+Convert Markdown to a styled HTML page.
+
+```bash
+# JSON body
+curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/html \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{"markdown": "# Hello\n\nThis is **bold** and *italic*."}' \
+  -o page.html
+
+# Raw markdown body
+curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/html \
+  -H "Content-Type: text/markdown" \
+  -d '# Hello World' \
+  -o page.html
+```
+
+### `POST /api/pdf`
+
+Convert Markdown to a PDF document.
+
+```bash
+curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/pdf \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{"markdown": "# Report\n\nSome content here."}' \
+  -o document.pdf
+```
+
+### `POST /api/raw`
+
+Convert Markdown to a raw HTML fragment (no page wrapper).
+
+```bash
+curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/raw \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{"markdown": "# Title\n\nParagraph with [link](https://example.com)."}'
+```
+
+### `GET /health`
