+# whois-api
+
+Domain WHOIS lookup API. Check domain registration details, availability, and raw WHOIS data.
+
+## Features
+
+- **WHOIS lookup** — get full registration details for any domain
+- **Domain availability check** — check if a domain is available
+- Registrar, creation/expiration dates, name servers
+- Status codes and DNSSEC info
+- Raw WHOIS data option
+- CORS enabled
+- Docker ready
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+pip install -r requirements.txt
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
+```
+
+OpenAPI docs at `http://localhost:8000/docs`
+
+## API Endpoints
+
+### WHOIS Lookup
+
+```
+GET /whois?domain=google.com&raw=false
+```
+
+Response:
+```json
+{
+  "domain": "google.com",
+  "registrar": "MarkMonitor Inc.",
+  "creation_date": "1997-09-15T04:00:00",
+  "expiration_date": "2028-09-14T04:00:00",
+  "updated_date": "2019-09-09T15:39:04",
+  "name_servers": ["ns1.google.com", "ns2.google.com"],
+  "status": ["clientDeleteProhibited", "clientTransferProhibited"],
+  "registrant": "Google LLC",
+  "emails": ["abusecomplaints@markmonitor.com"],
+  "dnssec": "unsigned"
+}
+```
+
+### Domain Availability Check
+
+```
+GET /check?domain=thisdomaindoesnotexist12345.com
+```
+
+Response:
+```json
+{
+  "domain": "thisdomaindoesnotexist12345.com",
+  "available": true,
+  "message": "thisdomaindoesnotexist12345.com appears to be available"
+}
+```
+
