+# dns-api
+
+Advanced DNS resolution API. Query any record type, reverse lookups, DMARC checks, and more. Built with dnspython.
+
+## Features
+
+- **DNS resolution** — A, AAAA, MX, NS, TXT, CNAME, SOA, SRV, CAA, PTR, DNSKEY
+- **All records** — fetch all common record types at once
+- **Reverse lookup** — IP to hostname
+- **DMARC check** — parse and inspect DMARC records
+- Custom nameserver support
+- CORS enabled
+- Docker ready
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+pip install -r requirements.txt
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
+```
+
+OpenAPI docs at `http://localhost:8000/docs`
+
+## API Endpoints
+
+### Resolve Records
+
+```
+GET /resolve?domain=google.com&type=MX
+```
+
+Response:
+```json
+{
+  "domain": "google.com",
+  "records": [
+    {"type": "MX", "ttl": 300, "value": "smtp.google.com", "priority": 10}
+  ],
+  "nameserver": null
+}
+```
+
+### All Records
+
+```
+GET /all?domain=google.com
+```
+
+Response:
+```json
+{
+  "domain": "google.com",
+  "results": {
+    "A": [{"type": "A", "ttl": 300, "value": "142.250.185.78"}],
+    "MX": [{"type": "MX", "ttl": 300, "value": "smtp.google.com", "priority": 10}],
+    "NS": [...],
+    "TXT": [...]
+  }
+}
+```
+
+### Reverse Lookup
+
+```
+GET /reverse?ip=8.8.8.8
+```
+
+Response:
+```json
+{
+  "domain": "8.8.8.8",
+  "records": [
+    {"type": "PTR", "ttl": 86400, "value": "dns.google."}
