+# text-summarizer-api
+
+Extractive text summarization API — no LLM, no external services. Scores sentences by word frequency, position, cue phrases, and length to extract the most important ones.
+
+## Features
+
+- **Extractive summarization** — picks the best sentences from the original text
+- **Multi-heuristic scoring**: word frequency, position, cue phrases, length, entities
+- **English & French** stop word support
+- **Adjustable ratio** — control how much to compress
+- **Max sentences cap** — hard limit on output length
+- **File upload** — summarize .txt or .md files directly
+- **Docker-ready**
+
+## Install
+
+### Local
+
+```bash
+pip install -r requirements.txt
+uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
+```
+
+### Docker
+
+```bash
+docker build -t text-summarizer-api .
+docker run -p 8000:8000 text-summarizer-api
+```
+
+## API Endpoints
+
+### `GET /`
+
+Service info.
+
+### `GET /health`
+
+Health check.
+
+### `POST /summarize`
+
+Summarize text from JSON body.
+
+**Request body:**
+
+```json
+{
+  "text": "Your long text here...",
+  "ratio": 0.3,
+  "max_sentences": null
+}
+```
+
