+# url-shortener
+
+URL shortener with click tracking, referrer stats, and custom codes. SQLite-backed, no external dependencies.
+
+## Features
+
+- **Shorten URLs** — auto-generated or custom short codes
+- **Click tracking** — every redirect is logged with referrer, user agent, IP
+- **Statistics** — click count, recent clicks, top referrers
+- **CRUD** — create, list, view stats, delete
+- **SQLite** — zero-config persistence
+- **Docker-ready** with volume mount for data
+
+## Install
+
+### Local
+
+```bash
+pip install -r requirements.txt
+uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
+```
+
+### Docker
+
+```bash
+docker build -t url-shortener .
+docker run -p 8000:8000 -v url-data:/app/data url-shortener
+```
+
+### Environment Variables
+
+| Variable | Default | Description |
+|----------|---------|-------------|
+| `DATABASE_PATH` | `urls.db` | SQLite database path |
+| `CODE_LENGTH` | `6` | Length of generated short codes |
+| `BASE_URL` | `http://localhost:8000` | Base URL for short links |
+
+## API Endpoints
