+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{"url": "https://example.com/very/long/path"}'
+
+# Custom code
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/shorten \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{"url": "https://github.com", "custom_code": "gh"}'
+```
+
+**Response:**
+
