+{
+  "short_url": "http://localhost:8000/aB3xZ",
+  "code": "aB3xZ",
+  "original_url": "https://example.com/very/long/path"
+}
+```
+
+### `GET /{code}`
+
+Redirect to original URL (307). Tracks the click automatically.
+
