+# paste-service
+
+Pastebin-like service with expiration, burn-after-read, and delete keys. SQLite-backed, no external dependencies.
+
+## Features
+
+- **Create pastes** — plain text with optional title and language hint
+- **Expiration** — 10m, 1h, 1d, 1w, 1m, 1y, or never
+- **Burn after read** — auto-delete after first view (planned)
+- **Delete keys** — each paste gets a secret delete URL
+- **Raw view** — `/paste/{id}/raw` for plain text
+- **View counter** — tracks how many times a paste was viewed
+- **Auto-cleanup** — expired pastes removed on health check
+- **1MB limit** — max paste size
+- **Docker-ready**
+
+## Install
+
+### Local
+
+```bash
+pip install -r requirements.txt
