+
+## API Endpoints
+
+### `POST /paste`
+
+Create a new paste.
+
+```bash
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/paste \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{
+    "content": "Hello, World!\nThis is my paste.",
+    "title": "My First Paste",
+    "language": "text",
+    "expiration": "1d"
+  }'
+```
