+**Request body:**
+
+| Field | Type | Default | Description |
+|-------|------|---------|-------------|
+| `content` | string | required | Paste content (max 1MB) |
+| `title` | string | null | Optional title |
+| `language` | string | null | Language hint (text, python, js, etc.) |
+| `expiration` | string | `1w` | `10m`, `1h`, `1d`, `1w`, `1m`, `1y`, `never` |
+| `burn_after_read` | bool | false | Delete after first view |
+
