+# meta-extractor
+
+Extrait les meta tags d'une page web : Open Graph, Twitter Card, description, title, canonical, et plus.
+
+## Fonctionnalités
+
+- Extraction des meta tags HTML standards (title, description, keywords, etc.)
+- Support complet Open Graph (`og:title`, `og:image`, `og:description`, etc.)
+- Support Twitter Card (`twitter:card`, `twitter:title`, etc.)
+- Détection du lien canonical
+- Catégorisation automatique des tags
+- Support multi-URLs en parallèle
+- Sortie JSON ou terminal formaté
+- Filtres `--og-only` et `--twitter-only`
+
+## Installation
+
+```bash
+pip install .
+```
+
+Ou depuis le repo :
+
+```bash
+pip install git+https://github.com/TataneSan/meta-extractor.git
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+# Extraire les meta tags d'une URL
+meta-extractor https://example.com
+
+# Sortie JSON
+meta-extractor https://example.com --json
+
+# Uniquement les Open Graph tags
+meta-extractor https://example.com --og-only
+
+# Uniquement les Twitter Card tags
+meta-extractor https://example.com --twitter-only
+
+# Plusieurs URLs
+meta-extractor https://site1.com https://site2.com --json
+
+# Exporter en fichier
+meta-extractor https://example.com --json -o meta.json
+```
+
+## Exemple de sortie
+
+```
+meta-extractor — Extraction de meta tags
+  URL(s): https://example.com
+
+══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+  https://example.com
+
+  Title
+    Example Domain
+
+  Description
+    This domain is for use in illustrative examples
+
+  Open Graph (og:)
+    og:title: Example Domain
+    og:description: This domain is for use in illustrative examples
+    og:type: website
+    og:url: https://example.com
+    og:image: https://example.com/og-image.png
+
+  Twitter Card
+    twitter:card: summary_large_image
+    twitter:title: Example Domain
+    twitter:image: https://example.com/twitter-image.png
+
+  Basic
+    description: This domain is for use in illustrative examples
