+# disk-usage
+
+Visualize disk usage as a treemap in the terminal.
+
+No dependencies. Pure Python. Just works.
+
+## Features
+
+- Scan directories recursively with configurable depth
+- Tree view with Unicode block bars showing proportional sizes
+- Flat treemap view for quick overview
+- Color-coded by size (green → cyan → blue → yellow → red)
+- Show top N largest files
+- Exclude patterns (skip `.git`, `node_modules`, etc.)
+- JSON output for scripting
+- Summary statistics (total size, file count, dir count)
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+# From PyPI
+pip install disk-usage-cli
+
+# From source
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/disk-usage.git
+cd disk-usage
+pip install .
+```
+
+No external dependencies — uses only Python stdlib.
+
+## Usage
+
+### Basic tree view
+
+```bash
+$ disk-usage ~/projects
+
+  Scanning /home/user/projects...
+
+  projects/                         ██████████████████████████████ 100.0%     2.3 GB
+    node_modules/                   ████████████████████░░░░░░░░░░  65.2%     1.5 GB
+    src/                            ██████████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░  22.1%   508.3 MB
+    .git/                           ████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░   8.4%   193.2 MB
+    package-lock.json               ██░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░   2.1%    48.3 MB
+    README.md                       ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░   0.1%    12.4 KB
+
+  Summary:
+  Total size: 2.3 GB
+  Files: 4,521
+  Directories: 312
+```
+
+### Treemap view
+
+```bash
+$ disk-usage . --treemap
+
+  2.3 GB total in projects/
+
+  ██████████████████████████████████████████████████████░░░░░░░░░░  65.2%      1.5 GB  node_modules/
+  ████████████████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░  22.1%    508.3 MB  src/
+  ██████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░   8.4%    193.2 MB  .git/
+  ███░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░   2.1%     48.3 MB  package-lock.json
+```
+
+### Control depth and top N
