+# 💰 expense-tracker
+
+A terminal expense tracker with SQLite persistence, category management, budgets, and export capabilities.
+
+## Features
+
+- Add, edit, and delete expenses
+- Category-based organization
+- Monthly/weekly/yearly summaries with visual bars
+- Budget tracking with alerts (80% warning, 100% exceeded)
+- Export to CSV or JSON
+- Date filtering and search
+- Color-coded terminal output
+- Data stored locally in SQLite
+
+## Installation
+
+```bash
+# From PyPI
+pip install expense-tracker
+
+# From source
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/expense-tracker.git
+cd expense-tracker
+pip install .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+### Add expenses
+
+```bash
+expense add 12.50 food "Lunch"
+expense add 45.00 transport "Gas" -d 2026-05-15
+expense add 120.00 shopping "New shoes"
+```
+
+### List expenses
+
+```bash
+expense list                        # All expenses
+expense list --category food        # By category
+expense list --month 2026-05        # By month
+expense list --from-date 2026-01-01 # Date range
+expense list -n 10                  # Last 10
+```
+
+### Summaries
+
+```bash
+expense summary                     # Current month
+expense summary --month 2026-04     # Specific month
+expense summary --year 2026         # Full year
+```
+
+### Budget management
+
+```bash
+expense budget set food 300         # Set 300€/month for food
+expense budget set transport 150
+expense budget list                 # View all budgets
+expense budget rm food              # Remove budget
+```
+
+### Edit and delete
+
+```bash
+expense edit 2 15.00 -c food        # Update amount and category
+expense rm 5                        # Delete expense
+```
+
+### Export
+
+```bash
+expense export --format csv -o expenses.csv
+expense export --format json -o expenses.json
+```
+
